{"theory":"n1-minimal-ad-da","member":{"at":6,"variant":"(D,A)-"},"chiral_algebra":"\\left(SU(2)_{4}\\times SU(2)_2/SU(2)_{6}\\right)","Z_tex":"Z = \\tfrac12\\sum N^{D}_{l\\tilde l}\\,N^{A}_{l'\\tilde l'}\\,b^{(l,\\epsilon,l')}\\overline{b^{(\\tilde l,\\epsilon,\\tilde l')}} - \\tfrac12","character_tex":"The $\\mathcal{N}=1$ characters $\\chi^{NS}_{r,s} = q^{-c/24}\\prod_{n\\ge1}\\frac{1+q^{n-1/2}}{1-q^n}\\sum_{k}\\left(q^{a_k}-q^{b_k}\\right)$ and $\\chi^{R}_{r,s} = q^{1/16-c/24}\\prod_{n\\ge1}\\frac{1+q^{n}}{1-q^n}\\sum_{k}\\left(q^{a_k}-q^{b_k}\\right)$, $a_k = \\frac{(2pp'k+p'r-ps)^2-4}{8pp'}$, $b_k = \\frac{(2pp'k+p'r+ps)^2-4}{8pp'}$, $(p,p') = (6,8)$. With $r = l+1$, $s = l'+1$: $b^{(l,0,l')}$ and $b^{(l,2,l')}$ are the parts of $\\chi^{NS}_{r,s}$ at integer and half-integer level (whichever matches the coset weight), and $b^{(l,1,l')} = \\chi^R_{r,s}$.","description":"Coset $SU(2)_{4}\\times SU(2)_2/SU(2)_{6}$ with the (D,A) invariant (D on the level-4 label, A on the level-6 label). Blocks are the coset branching functions $b^{(l,\\epsilon,l')}$ with $(l,\\epsilon,l')\\sim(4-l,2-\\epsilon,6-l')$. The Ramond ground state $(2,1,3)$ is a fixed point of the identification; its two resolved components $b_\\pm$ differ by the constant 1, and the sign pairs $b_+$ with $b_-$, so the ground state appears at $(c/24, c/24+1)$.","generator":"scripts/spectra/gen_n1.py","c":"5/4","irreducible":true,"cutoff":"581/96","s_error":1.2e-14,"gap":"1/6","blocks":[{"label":"b^{(0,0,0)}","h":"0","coeffs":[1,0,1,1,3,3,7,8]},{"label":"b^{(0,0,2)}","h":"3/4","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,8,11,19]},{"label":"b^{(0,0,4)}","h":"5/4","coeffs":[1,1,3,4,8,12]},{"label":"b^{(0,0,6)}","h":"7/2","coeffs":[1,2,3,5]},{"label":"b^{(0,1,1)}","h":"3/32","coeffs":[1,1,2,4,6,10,16]},{"label":"b^{(0,1,3)}","h":"23/32","coeffs":[1,2,3,6,10,16,26]},{"label":"b^{(0,1,5)}","h":"67/32","coeffs":[1,2,4,7,12]},{"label":"b^{(0,2,0)}","h":"3/2","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,5,7]},{"label":"b^{(0,2,2)}","h":"1/4","coeffs":[1,1,2,3,6,9,